<title>USA: USDA amends Ukraine PL-480 grain authorization.</title>
<headline>USDA amends Ukraine PL-480 grain authorization.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Thursday it was increasing soymeal purchase authorizations and decreasing wheat authorizations for Ukraine under Title I of the PL-480 program.</p>
<p>The value of soymeal authorizations was increased to $20 million from $10 million, and the quantity to approximately 74,000 tonnes from 37,000 tonnes, USDA said.</p>
<p>The value of wheat authorized under the program was decreased to zero, USDA said.</p>
<p>-- Washington Commodities Desk (202) 898-8394</p>
</text>
